e engine adds a kind. Not a\nsecurity posture.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014BCPobQSCvqFqbgHk2aZzo\nEOF",
